      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>Fix: installing an update could shut the background server down and fail to start it again, leaving every client showing an empty vault. Restarting the server now waits for macOS instead of racing it, and no longer freezes the app while it works.</description>
